----
; Blocks {{Sound||Grass dig1.ogg}}{{Sound||Grass dig2.ogg}}{{Sound||Grass dig3.ogg}}{{Sound||Grass dig4.ogg}} <div class="tright"; style="font-family:Minecraft">100%</div>
